1
00:00:00,754 --> 00:00:03,324
(Amy:)FYI, it's another cardigan.

2
00:00:05,692 --> 00:00:08,832
(Bernadette:)Your short, sexed-up guy
kind of sounds like Howard.

3
00:00:08,996 --> 00:00:12,106
(Amy:)Your brainy virgin
kind of sounds like Sheldon.

4
00:00:13,166 --> 00:00:15,046
(Penny:)-Good night.
-Night.

5
00:00:18,205 --> 00:00:20,985
(Mrs Davis:)All right, Dr. Koothrappali,
it's been nice talking to you,

6
00:00:21,141 --> 00:00:22,951
(Mrs Davis:)but I need to go home
and relieve my babysitter.

7
00:00:23,110 --> 00:00:27,150
(Raj:)I can relate to being
a single parent. I have a dog.

8
00:00:27,314 --> 00:00:31,324
(Mrs Davis:)Yeah, it's exactly the same thing.
Good night.

9
00:00:31,485 --> 00:00:32,865
(Howard:)Mrs. Davis...

10
00:00:33,020 --> 00:00:36,900
(Raj:)I, uh... I must confess,
I came here tonight

11
00:00:37,057 --> 00:00:39,897
(Raj:)in a futile attempt
to pick up some lonely post-doc,

12
00:00:40,060 --> 00:00:44,010
(Raj:)but instead I got to connect
with you at a human level.

13
00:00:44,164 --> 00:00:46,734
(Raj:)That's a much better evening.

14
00:00:47,801 --> 00:00:49,711
(Raj:)You're a lovely person.

15
00:00:49,870 --> 00:00:53,750
(Mrs Davis:)-Are you hitting on me?
-No, no, no, that would be crazy!

16
00:00:53,907 --> 00:00:55,477
(Raj:)I mean, if I were hitting on you,
you'd know it

17
00:00:55,642 --> 00:01:01,022
(Raj:)'cause you'd feel uncomfortable
and a little sad for me.

